 143:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c **** /**
 144:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * Create a TCP segment with prefilled header.
 145:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  *
 146:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * Called by @ref tcp_write, @ref tcp_enqueue_flags and @ref tcp_split_unsent_seg
 147:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  *
 148:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/tcp_out.c ****  * @param pcb Protocol control block for the TCP connection.
